00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 8.8 · Marketing & Communications
Content strategy and editorial calendar

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Plan a few themes and a realistic rhythm, then reuse what works.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Choose three to five pillars linked to your objectives.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Plan a month ahead around your own key dates.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Make one piece work in several places.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.800
An example: Vanita Weavers Cooperative (Cooperative · member-owned, India)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“July: first look at Vanita Onam 2027, a weaver’s story she approved, a care tip, an intake call to families.”

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.400
You create content pillars and one month of your calendar.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.000
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
